{"id":"399e79d7cc96c3d4","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_L3Proof.md","title":"L3Proof","display":"L3Proof","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"L3Proof","parameters":["g","p","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"L3Proof"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>g</span><span>p</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：三值语义与有限表证书。有序参数：<code>g</code>、<code>p</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>完整枚举网格与逐子式求值表；少一个赋值行也不是证书。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ L3Proof g p a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists P\n  (exists V\n    (exists Q\n      (exists H\n        (and\n          (exists z4833 (and (exists z4834 (and (@ Pair Q H z4834) (@ Pair V z4834 z4833))) (@ Pair P z4833 p)))\n          (and\n            (@ L3Grid g a P V)\n            (and\n              (@ L3Relevant g a Q)\n              (and\n                (@ Finite Q)\n                (and\n                  (@ FunDom H V)\n                  (forall v\n                    (implies\n                      (in v V)\n                      (exists h\n                        (exists two\n                          (and\n                            (@ App H v h)\n                            (and\n                            (@ L3EvalRow v Q h)\n                            (and (@ Num2 two) (implies (forall b (implies (in b g) (@ App h b two))) (@ App h a two))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ee0b315916cb8bff\" href=\"?note=ee0b315916cb8bff\" title=\"ZFC_Finite\">Finite</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2fa14e4bd3447c97\" href=\"?note=2fa14e4bd3447c97\" title=\"ZFC_FunDom\">FunDom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a432614896241213\" href=\"?note=a432614896241213\" title=\"ZFC_L3EvalRow\">L3EvalRow</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8dfa83196961379b\" href=\"?note=8dfa83196961379b\" title=\"ZFC_L3Grid\">L3Grid</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6c6245d4da289ece\" href=\"?note=6c6245d4da289ece\" title=\"ZFC_L3Relevant\">L3Relevant</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36fc33b3a64f5aa9\" href=\"?note=36fc33b3a64f5aa9\" title=\"ZFC_Num2\">Num2</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ L3Proof g p a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Finite|Finite]]；[[ZFC_FunDom|FunDom]]；[[ZFC_L3EvalRow|L3EvalRow]]；[[ZFC_L3Grid|L3Grid]]；[[ZFC_L3Relevant|L3Relevant]]；[[ZFC_Num2|Num2]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Finite","status":"